# Crystal Imperium play test: Heart & Soul's Ace Trainers with competitive teams (DECISIONS.md D47)
# Each loads with its whole team at the player's level cap, its stage's (D56), against the
# prepared six at that cap, and plays to a result (naive play).
# gEnemyParty: 100 bytes a Pokemon, level at +84; gEnemyPartyCount is the team size.
!new_game()
!battle_style_set()
!no_care_packages()
savestate base.ss

# Stage 3: cap 42
loadstate base.ss
!set_flag("FLAG_BADGE01_GET")
!set_flag("FLAG_BADGE02_GET")
!set_flag("FLAG_BADGE03_GET")
!prepared_team(42, items=True)
savestate stage3.ss
loadstate stage3.ss
!battle("TRAINER_IRENE_HNS")
waituntil32 {gBattlerControllerFuncs} {HandleInputChooseAction@battle_controller_player} 4000 B irene_action_menu
expect8 {gEnemyPartyCount} 5 irene_has_5
expect8 {gEnemyParty+84} 42 irene_lead_at_42
expect8 {gEnemyParty+484} 42 irene_last_at_42
!autobattle("0,0,0,0,0,0")
expectne8 {gBattleOutcome} 0 irene_resolved

